            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "At maximum aperture (f/1.8), the center of the frame is surprisingly crisp and renders fine details sharply.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
