            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "At the widest aperture (f/1.8), the lens is very sharp in the center and mid-frame, though corners remain slightly softer.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
            "source_type": "reviewer_blog",
            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "By f/8, even corners reach excellent sharpness.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
            "source_type": "reviewer_blog",
            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "For portrait distances, the center and inner-circle are very sharp; the outer circle performs adequately at f/1.8 with improvement when stopped down.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
            "source_type": "reviewer_blog",
            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "At close-focus distances, sharpness is just a little soft at f/1.8 with pronounced purple fringing, very good at f/4, and excellent by f/5.6; diffraction appears at f/11 and more at f/16 though images remain usable.Chromatic aberration.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
            "source_type": "reviewer_blog",
            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "A mix of praise and criticism: strengths are sharpness, distortion correction, compact size, and price; weaknesses are chromatic-aberration severity, heavy focus breathing, imperfect flare resistance, and the absence of manual focus.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
          {
            "source_id": "phillipreeve-net-blog-review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo",
            "source_type": "reviewer_blog",
            "url": "https://phillipreeve.net/blog/review-ttartisan-af-85mm-f-1-8-neo/",
            "weight": 0.75,
            "quote_excerpt": "It targets photographers who rely on a kit zoom and want shallow depth of field for portraits with solid sharpness on a tight budget and don't need manual focus override.",
            "witness": "unattested"
          },
